### User Credit System API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar HTTP client
### Replace {{adminToken}} and {{userId}} with actual values

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@userId = 1

### 1. Login as Admin (Get Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Get All Users with Credits Summary
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/credits/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Add Credits to User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/credits/add
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "notes": "Testing credit addition via API"
}

### 4. Get User Credit Transaction History
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/credits/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Reset User Games Played Counter
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/credits/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Get Specific User Details (verify credits and gamesPlayed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Get All Users (includes credits and gamesPlayed fields)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

